{
  "title": "Jazzed Citrusy Argentinian Chinese Broccoli Empanadas",
  "description": "A romantic Argentinian dish featuring Chinese broccoli, with a citrusy and crumbly texture, baked in a salt crust and wrapped in banana leaves, perfect for a low glycemic diet",
